---
const areas = [
  { title: 'Ecommerce that fits the operation', href: '/services/ecommerce/', text: 'Shopify, Medusa.js or Zoho Commerce implementation and customisation, selected around catalogue complexity, checkout requirements, subscriptions and the team maintaining the store.' },
  { title: 'Business systems that connect the work', href: '/services/custom-crm-erp-solutions/', text: 'Custom CRM and ERP workflows, ERPNext customisation and scoped integrations for enquiries, approvals, stock and reporting. Discovery establishes which existing systems should remain.' },
  { title: 'Content across languages and channels', href: '/services/headless-cms-development/', text: 'Payload CMS or Directus for structured content and publishing permissions. English and Arabic content architecture, language switching and right-to-left interfaces can be separately scoped.' },
];
---
<section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="uae-implementation">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--accent)]">India-based implementation · UAE business requirements</p>
    <h2 id="uae-implementation" class="mt-3 max-w-4xl font-heading text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Connect your storefront, content and business workflows.</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">Work remotely with our Nagpur studio. We do not claim a Dubai office or UAE project references on this page. Start with the systems you operate, the languages your customers use and the outcomes your team needs.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">{areas.map(area => <article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-6"><h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">{area.title}</h3><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">{area.text}</p><a href={area.href} class="mt-5 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-semibold text-[var(--accent)]">Explore the service →</a></article>)}</div>
    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-6 sm:p-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <article><h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">Arabic / English: implementation is not translation</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">Agree the language coverage of pages, product data, forms, transactional messages and search metadata. We can implement RTL layouts and language switching; a qualified Arabic specialist must supply or approve translation, terminology and cultural review. Arabic-language support staffing is not assumed.</p></article>
      <article><h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">Integrations: validate before promising</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">Confirm payment-gateway eligibility, merchant onboarding, API access, shipping coverage, tax configuration and accounting or CRM interfaces before committing to a feature. Availability depends on the platform plan and provider. Tax and regulatory decisions remain with your qualified advisers.</p></article>
      <article><h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">Remote delivery with written checkpoints</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">The UAE is 1.5 hours behind India. Agree meeting windows, approval owners, staged demonstrations and acceptance tests at kickoff. Delivery dates depend on signed scope, content readiness and third-party access—not a blanket turnaround promise.</p></article>
      <article><h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">A proposal that separates the costs</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">Separate implementation, localisation, hosting, licences, API charges, maintenance and upgrades. Confirm source-code rights, application ownership, hosting location, data access and handover against the proposal and payment terms.</p></article>
    </div>
<aside class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border)] p-6"><h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">Relevant work—not UAE client claims</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">Explore Rangresha’s Shopify storefront and Healthy Genie’s Medusa.js commerce implementation as examples of platform experience. These projects are not presented as UAE deployments or guarantees of results.</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-5"><a href="https://rangresha.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-semibold text-[var(--accent)]">Rangresha · Shopify ↗</a><a href="https://healthygenie.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-semibold text-[var(--accent)]">Healthy Genie · Medusa.js ↗</a><a href="/blog/ecommerce/shopify-vs-medusa-js-2026/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-semibold text-[var(--accent)]">Compare the operating costs →</a></div></aside>
    <aside class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-6">
      <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">Before commissioning a UAE online store</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-[var(--text-dim)]">Work through Arabic/English coverage, payments, shipping, stock ownership and handover before choosing the platform.</p>
      <a href="/blog/ecommerce/uae-ecommerce-implementation-checklist/" class="mt-3 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-semibold text-[var(--accent)]">Read the UAE ecommerce checklist →</a>
    </aside>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="/get-quote/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--accent)] px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-[var(--bg)]">Discuss a UAE implementation →</a><a href="/schedule-consultation/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] px-6 py-3 font-semibold">Plan a discovery call</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
